Changes in this fork
--------------------

- Replaced the list-card appearance with a macOS-style horizontal bar of
  window icons. The selected window's title is drawn centred beneath the bar.
- Generalized icon resolution with a user-configurable `iconOverrides` list
  (match by window class, optionally by title) instead of hard-coding a single
  application's icon.
- Removed the `showIcons` setting, which is meaningless for an icon-only bar.

